    "body": "## Summary\n- Fix Issue #46316: When `flashinfer_megamoe` is used as the a2a backend with dp-attention, the transport rows declare `group=None` (because ep=True), but `MoeTransport.prepare_output()` was wrapping `MoEOutput` in `MoeFinalize` whose `completion_group=SumGroup.MOE_OUTPUT` fails validation against empty groups tuple.\n- The fix checks if `self.rows.group is None` when `MoEOutput` is received, and if so, calls `hidden_states.get_merged()` to complete the merge immediately instead of wrapping in `MoeFinalize`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Verify that flashinfer_megamoe backend with dp-attention no longer raises \"transport finalize owes an undeclared sum group\" error\n- [ ] Verify that other a2a backends (deepep, mooncake, nixl, mori, etc.) still work correctly\n- [ ] Verify that non-ep configurations still work correctly\n- [ ] Run existing MoE tests to ensure no regressions\n\nFixes #46316\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40164669514](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164669514)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40164669654](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164669654)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40164669670](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40164669670)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
